346
00:36:24,692 --> 00:36:29,192
上べよりも胸の奥の奥を温めるもの
something that warms deep within your chest rather than the surface.

347
00:36:29,192 --> 00:36:34,892
理想だけはあるけど 心のどこ探しても まるで見つからないんだよ
I have my ideals, but no matter where I search in my heart, I can't find it at all.

348
00:36:35,092 --> 00:36:39,392
伝えたい 伝わらない そこに条理が今
I want to convey, but it doesn't get across, and right there lies logic,

349
